### Create a workflow
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{"requirement": "Create a Spring Boot REST API for managing tasks with CRUD operations and validation."}

### Poll status (replace the id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows/{{id}}

### Approve execution of the generated code (needed when require-approval=true)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows/{{id}}/approve

### Artifacts / report / cancel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows/{{id}}/artifacts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows/{{id}}/report
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workflows/{{id}}/cancel
